      <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms of Service ("Terms") are an agreement between you and <strong>Anomaly Labs LLC</strong> ("we", "our", "us"), the operator of parry. By downloading, installing, or using parry ("the App" or "the Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree to these Terms, do not use the Service.
