      </p>

      <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
      <p>
        parry is an AI-powered mobile application that generates message reply suggestions. The Service uses an AI system (specifically, Anthropic's Claude™) to analyze input text and images and provide reply options. <strong>When you use parry's generation feature, you are interacting with an AI system, not a human.</strong> This disclosure is provided to satisfy the transparency obligation in Article 50(1) of the EU AI Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689).
      </p>

      <h2>3. AI Data Processing and Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit text or images to parry, that content is sent to Anthropic's servers for AI processing. Anthropic's published policy provides that it automatically deletes inputs and outputs from its backend within <strong>30 days</strong> of receipt or generation (see Anthropic's <a href="https://privacy.claude.com/en/articles/7996866" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">data retention article</a>). For content flagged as violating Anthropic's Usage Policy, Anthropic may retain inputs and outputs for up to 2 years and safety classification scores for up to 7 years. Your data is <strong>not</strong> used to train AI models. For more information, see <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Anthropic's Privacy Policy</a> and our own <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Use of the Service</h2>
      <p>
        Your use of parry must comply with our <a href="/usage">Usage Policy</a>, which is incorporated into these Terms by reference. The Usage Policy describes (a) subscription usage limits, (b) what you can and cannot use parry for, including prohibited content categories, (c) the flow-down requirements of Anthropic's Usage Policy, and (d) the consequences of violating any of the above. Violating the Usage Policy is a breach of these Terms.
      </p>
      <p>In summary, you agree:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>To use parry only for lawful purposes</li>
        <li>Not to use parry to harass, threaten, defraud, manipulate, or harm others</li>
        <li>Not to attempt to circumvent the Service's security or rate limits</li>
        <li>Not to use parry to generate illegal content, content sexualizing minors, or content that violates Anthropic's Usage Policy</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. AI-Generated Content</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Responses are generated by AI and may be inaccurate, inappropriate, or unsuitable for your specific situation</li>
        <li>You are responsible for reviewing and editing responses before sending them</li>
        <li>We do not guarantee the accuracy, appropriateness, or fitness-for-purpose of AI-generated content</li>
        <li>Do not rely on AI suggestions for critical, time-sensitive, or high-stakes communications without your own judgment</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>User Responsibility</h3>
      <p>
        Reply suggestions generated by the Service are created by artificial intelligence and are provided for informational purposes only. You are solely responsible for reviewing, editing, and deciding whether to use any AI-generated suggestion. By sending a message based on an AI suggestion, you assume full responsibility for that message and its consequences. parry suggests; you decide.
      </p>

      <h3>No Professional Advice</h3>
      <p>
        parry does not provide legal, medical, psychiatric, psychological, therapeutic, financial, tax, or any other form of professional advice. AI-generated suggestions are not a substitute for professional judgment. If you need professional advice, consult a qualified professional. parry is not a healthcare service and is not a crisis-response service. If you or someone you know is in crisis, in the United States call or text 988 (Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline) or text HOME to 741741 (Crisis Text Line).
      </p>

      <h3>Output Non-Uniqueness</h3>
      <p>
        AI-generated suggestions are not unique to you. Other users providing similar input may receive the same or substantially similar suggestions. You should not expect exclusivity over any AI-generated content.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Subscriptions and Payments</h2>
      <p>
        parry offers a Free tier and an auto-renewing Pro subscription. The Pro subscription's daily generation limits and other terms are described in the <a href="/usage">Usage Policy</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Apple-billed subscriptions.</strong> Pro subscriptions purchased through the iOS App Store are sold and billed by Apple under Apple's Media Services Terms. The following applies:
      </p>
