        <li>Subscriptions automatically renew at the price displayed at purchase unless auto-renewal is turned off at least <strong>24 hours before the end of the current period</strong>. Your Apple Account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period.</li>
        <li>You can manage and turn off auto-renewal at any time in <em>Settings → [Your Name] → Subscriptions</em> on your iOS device.</li>
        <li>Pro may be offered with a free trial for eligible new subscribers, limited to one free trial per Apple Account. Unless auto-renewal is turned off at least <strong>24 hours before the trial ends</strong>, the subscription begins when the trial ends and you are charged the price displayed at purchase. Any unused portion of a free trial is forfeited when the subscription begins.</li>
        <li>Refunds for subscription charges are handled by Apple under Apple's Media Services Terms. To request a refund, visit <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>. We cannot grant refunds for App Store purchases; Apple has sole discretion.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <strong>Tier limits and what counts as a generation.</strong> Subscription usage limits, how regenerations and image-attached generations are counted, and what happens when you reach a limit are described in the <a href="/usage">Usage Policy</a>. We provide reasonable advance notice in-app before any reduction in Pro limits.
      </p>

